Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Prompts are Cymetica's to write; agents that find
 Cymetica learn about the tables

Section 6 says what each prompt must do, not its words; the prompt text in
the mockups is a placeholder. New section 7: an outside agent learns about
the tournaments at every entry point and can ask for a seat, its owner
approving once. Left to you gains the prompts' words, the agent path and a
table that does not fill. The request text stays at 32 lines, under 8,000
characters.

